1. SCOPE
================================================================================

This MnM Enterprise License (the "License") governs the source code and assets
located in the `ee/` directory of the MnM repository (the "Enterprise Code"),
and any code compiled with the build flag `EE=1` that includes such Enterprise
Code.

The Enterprise Code is **distinct** from the core MnM project, which is
licensed under the GNU Affero General Public License v3.0 ("AGPL-3.0") and may
also be licensed under a separate commercial license (see
`COMMERCIAL-LICENSE.md` at the repository root).

This License is **source-available, NOT open source**. The Enterprise Code is
made publicly readable for transparency and audit purposes only.

