================================================================================

Subject to Your compliance with the terms of this License AND the existence of
an active commercial Enterprise subscription with Alpha Luppi, Alpha Luppi
grants You a non-exclusive, non-transferable, revocable, worldwide, limited
license to:

(a) View and read the Enterprise Code in this repository.
(b) Use the Enterprise Code internally, in object form (after build with
    `EE=1`), within the scope and seat count specified in Your subscription.
(c) Make modifications strictly necessary for internal use, integration, or
    bug-fixing within Your organization, provided that such modifications
    are not redistributed.

Without an active subscription, Your rights are limited to (a) only:
viewing the source for evaluation, security audit, or academic study.

