================================================================================
4. BUILD FLAG
================================================================================

The Enterprise Code is gated behind the build flag `EE=1`. Builds without this
flag (i.e., `bun run build` without `EE=1`) compile only the AGPL core and do
NOT include the Enterprise Code in the resulting artifacts.

Use of `EE=1` in a production environment requires an active commercial
Enterprise subscription. Use of `EE=1` for development, testing, or evaluation
purposes is permitted for up to thirty (30) days without a subscription.

